@ T-395: THE NEXUS's words, and the singing fir's (tools/gbanexusmap.py). Every word approved by the user, 2026-10-10.

Text_SingingFir_Hums::
    .string "The fir's branches stir.\n"
    .string "It hums an old tune.$"

Text_SingingFir_Off::
    .string "Close to right, all the way\n"
    .string "through. Something is missing.\p"
    .string "And the fir looks faded, like\n"
    .string "a painting left in the sun.$"

Text_SingingFir_HoldUpSheet::
    .string "{PLAYER} held up the band's sheet.\p"
    .string "The fir hums the tune again.$"

Text_SingingFir_Right::
    .string "The same notes.\n"
    .string "This time, every one is home.$"

Text_SingingFir_Door::
    .string "The branches part, like a door.\n"
    .string "Go through?$"

Text_SingingFir_FirstTime::
    .string "On the other side, everything\n"
    .string "is made of paint.$"

Nexus_Text_Voice::
    .string "A voice carries across the paint.$"

Nexus_Text_DoorOpen::
    .string "This tree stands open, like a door.\n"
    .string "Go through?$"

Nexus_Text_Locked1::
    .string "The door won't open.\p"
    .string "The harder {PLAYER} tries,\n"
    .string "the less real it becomes…$"

Nexus_Text_Locked2::
    .string "…until it is only\n"
    .string "dots and lines.$"

Nexus_Text_Locked3::
    .string "Only a drawing of a tree.$"

Nexus_Text_Christmas::
    .string "The tree glows a different colour\n"
    .string "with every note.\p"
    .string "Go home?$"

Nexus_Text_GuardianHome::
    .string "“Those notes were never flat.\n"
    .string "They were only misunderstood.\p"
    .string "You may return home.”$"

Nexus_Text_HunterFirst::
    .string "Red plaid, in the dark.\n"
    .string "A hunter?\p"
    .string "Hunter? I'm no hunter…\n"
    .string "not anymore.\p"
    .string "And frankly, I never was\n"
    .string "to begin with.\p"
    .string "How could anyone hurt these\n"
    .string "DAEMONS? They are precious.\p"
    .string "…Now why would you turn back?\n"
    .string "Why would my tone make you buckle?\p"
    .string "Charm must be balanced with\n"
    .string "firmness, or you are only\l"
    .string "speaking in mirages.\p"
    .string "And keep faith. Don't let walls\n"
    .string "be placed where doors should be.$"

Nexus_Text_Hunter::
    .string "These DAEMONS are precious.\n"
    .string "Mind how you walk among them.$"

Nexus_Text_HunterAll::
    .string "Every door here is open to you now.\n"
    .string "They always were.$"

Nexus_Text_Phoenix::
    .string "Its cry rings out, and the shadows\n"
    .string "in the paint come clear!$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian0::
    .string "“Remember what you have learned!”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian1::
    .string "“The door was always there.\n"
    .string "You just could not see it.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian2::
    .string "“Just because you cannot see it\n"
    .string "does not mean you can't believe it.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian3::
    .string "“You have passed more tests\n"
    .string "than you realize.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian4::
    .string "“Perhaps now is the time to gaze\n"
    .string "beyond your reflection.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian5::
    .string "“What you hold is more than a mirror.\n"
    .string "It is also a window.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian6::
    .string "“You still have more work\n"
    .string "in front of you.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian7::
    .string "“This world belongs to everyone.\n"
    .string "Show you care, and do not run.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian8::
    .string "“Every universe has a mirror.\p"
    .string "Your heart alongside your head\n"
    .string "will be your compass.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian9::
    .string "“Enter from a place of love,\n"
    .string "otherwise you will not arrive\l"
    .string "where you expect.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian10::
    .string "“Everything exists in a duality.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian11::
    .string "“You were never lost…”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian12::
    .string "“Believe in yourself,\n"
    .string "and use your senses.”$"

Nexus_Text_Guardian13::
    .string "“Shed those fears, and ask them now.\n"
    .string "I promise it will mean a ton.”$"
